{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "about": "Game music -> lossless remaster mapping for convert_datadir --lossless-music-dir. The converter selects the source whose identity.music_sha256 equals the sha256 of every .wav/.ogg file in the datadir's Musics directory, and fails when none matches. Remaster files live in the lossless drop (lossless_root or its top level). A remaster whose duration differs from its game track by more than max(0.25 s, 3%), capped at 2 s, fails the conversion unless the game file is listed in intentional_duration_edits.",
  "lossless_root": "Music",
  "correlation_method": "Peak normalized whole-track waveform correlation after FFmpeg decoding, mono downmix, 4000 Hz resampling, and 100 ms edge trimming; recomputed 2026-09-14 (scipy FFT cross-correlation, peak |corr| / (|x||y|))",
  "todo": [
    "fullgame_gog (the WAV release this table was first built from) and demo_lincoln were not available on the machine that built schema 2; add their sections (identity + verified correlations) when they are."
  ],
